Package: tls-scanner
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-psutil
Maintainer: TLS Scanner Contributors
Description: Scan active TLS connections and show the owning process
 tls-scanner enumerates established TCP connections, maps each connection
 to its owning process, and can probe remote endpoints for TLS details.
 Run as root for full visibility of connections owned by other users.
